      <li><strong>Customer</strong>: anyone who visits a Creator’s page, buys an offering, books a session, joins a membership or submits a form.</li>
      <li><strong>Offering</strong>: anything a Creator lists through PageZaper, including digital products, courses, memberships, bookings, coaching sessions, event tickets and lead magnets.</li>
      <li><strong>Creator Content</strong>: text, images, videos, files and other material a Creator uploads or publishes through the Services.</li>
