      <li>Publish your own refund, cancellation and rescheduling policy on your page, and honour it.</li>
      <li>Handle Customer data responsibly and lawfully, use it only for the purpose it was collected, and respect Customers’ requests to stop contacting them.</li>
      <li>Hold all licences, qualifications and permissions needed for what you offer (for example, professional services or health-related coaching).</li>
