    <h2 id="payments">6. Fees, payments &amp; payouts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Plans:</strong> PageZaper offers a free plan and paid plans. Current features and prices are shown on our website and in your dashboard. Paid plans are billed in advance and renew automatically until cancelled.</li>
