      <li><strong>Payment processing:</strong> payments are processed by third-party payment partners. By selling or buying through PageZaper, you also agree to their terms. We do not store full card numbers.</li>
      <li><strong>Payouts:</strong> Creator earnings, minus applicable fees, refunds and chargebacks, are paid to the verified bank account on the schedule shown in your dashboard. We may hold payouts if we suspect fraud, a policy violation or a high risk of chargebacks, or if required by law or our payment partners.</li>
